 "remarks": "Downtown Darien's Corbin District  Experience downtown living in this stunning 1,470-square-foot penthouse residence located at 15 Corbin Drive. This beautifully designed corner residence offers an incredibly spacious open concept chefs kitchen with quartz countertops/ living area with oversize walls of windows and tons of natural light with 9ft+ ceilings. In addition, there are 2 generous bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, and 1 convenient half bath. Building amenities include access to a shared rooftop terrace/courtyard, elevator service from a secure lower-level garage, and professional management.  This residence perfectly blends modern luxury with an unbeatable walk to shops, restaurants, and fitness options, located in downtown Darien.  (photos are representative of similar unit and may not be actual unit)",
